  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>WriteAccessor is used to write file data. It provides the WriteBinary and WriteText methods featuring a Result for controlled, unformatted writing, and the operator&lt;&lt; method for simple formatted writing. It also provides SyncToFile() to flush the buffer of the operating system to the physical storage.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
